  "research": {
    "presetId": "royal_match",
    "revision": "2026-09-14.1",
    "category": "Mobile",
    "summary": "Level wins fund castle progress; failure, retries and boosters create the spending loop.",
    "scope": "Core match-3 levels, area tasks, lives, coin spending and Royal Pass; individual event rules excluded.",
    "checkedAt": "2026-09-14",
    "limitations": [
      "Lives gate attempts but are deducted on failure, not on every attempt. Unlimited-life periods are an exception.",
      "Royal Pass rewards and event contents vary. Keys represent pass progress; they are not a shop currency.",
      "Qualitative resource flows, not a balance simulation. Prices, odds and reward quantities are intentionally omitted. Sources were reviewed on the checked date; this is desk research, not a claim of live playtesting."
    ],
